<a name="intro"></a>
<h3>Introduction</h3>

The <a href="../classes/html/classprotocolentry.html">protocolentry class</a> provides methods for retrieving network protocol definitions.  These are usually defined in a file like /etc/protocols on unix-like systems or C:\Windows\System32\drivers\etc\protocol on Windows, or are served from another source via the name-service switch.

Protocols can be looked up by name or number.


<a name="name"></a>
<h3>Lookup By Name</h3>

This example retrieves network protocol information for the "tcp" protocol.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@protocolentry-name.cpp.html@
}}}
}}}


